###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - No energy or force errors are stated; models are compared by pair interaction energies, RDF similarity scores and coordination numbers across densities and temperatures (Figs. 2-6).
# - SevenNet variants are mapped to NequIP as before; none of the 7net checkpoints names a release that matches a registry model, so all are paper-local runs. Training-set sizes for the CO2 baseline are not stated beyond the 1024 added frames.
